        {
            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "The `tangle` check fails only on `libraries/modules/custom/sp-thesis-dump.el`, which this PR does not touch (`sp-browsing.el` and `sp-search.el` agree with their docs). The same drift is on `main`: the file was edited there after #201, and #205 removes it and so fixes this. I am not widening this PR; the check should go green once #205 is merged and this branch takes `main`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
